    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 20</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þæt we magan ⁊ moton ealle samod, þurh þæs ecean Godes mildheortnesse ⁊ his halgena þingrædne, to heofena rices myrhðe becuman ⁊ mid him wunian þe leofað ⁊ rihxað a butan ende. Amen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">So that, through the mercy of the eternal God and the intercession of his saints, we may all together have power and permission to attain to the joy of the kingdom of Heaven and to dwell with Him who liveth and reigneth for ever without end. Amen.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
